<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My flesh and my heart faileth.</l><l>But God is the strength of my heart</l><l>And my portion forever.</l><l>(Repeat 2)</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Nevertheless, I am continually with Thee;</l><l>Thou hast holden me by my right hand;</l><l>Thou shalt guide me with Thy counsel and</l><l>Afterwards receive me to glory.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>One thing have I desired of the Lord;</l><l>That will I seek after,</l><l>That I may dwell in the house of the Lord.</l><l>(Repeat 4)</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>I may dwell in the house of the Lord,</l><l>All the days of my life,</l><l>To behold the beauty of the Lord</l><l>And to inquire in His temple.</l></lg>
<lg label="1."><l>Sisters' part:</l><l>I am continually with Thee;</l><l>Thou hast beholden me by my right hand.</l><l>I am continually with Thee;</l><l>Thou hast holden me by my right hand.</l></lg>
<lg label="2."><l>He is my refuge</l><l>And my fortress;</l><l>My God, in Him will I trust.</l><l>(Repeat 2)</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I have set the Lord</l><l>Always before me;</l><l>He is at my right hand;</l><l>I shall not be moved.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Blessed are they</l><l>That dwell in the house;</l><l>They will be praising Thee all the day long.</l><l>(Repeat 4)</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>There is a river</l><l>Whose streams make glad</l><l>The city of our God.</l><l>God is in the midst of her.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
